# FENIX Runtime Skill Global

Select the smallest skill context for the requested objective. Use runtime skills under `grg/skills/` first, then project skills from `FENIX_SKILL_PATHS` when configured.

For agent tasks, attach skill ids and compact context only. Never persist full skill bodies or any field containing `token`, `secret`, `password`, or API keys in event payloads.
